{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Sonuvabitch!": "",
  "You bastard...": "",
  "Can you hear me, Yagami-san?\nAre you still coming?": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san, you hear me?\nAre you still coming?": "",
  "I'm coming. How's Mafuyu?": "",
  "Sugiura!\nMafuyu still okay?": "",
  "Safe. Over on Nakamichi Street now.\nHer and, uh... four more yakuza.": "",
  "Yeah. She's over on Nakamichi Street now.\nHer and, uh... four more yakuza.": "",
  "I dunno if I can take 'em on my own.": "",
  "I dunno if I can take 'em\non my own.": "",
  "Got it.\nI'm turning onto Nakamichi Street now.": "",
  "Hurry, okay?": "",
  "Hurry.": "",
  "Watch your back, Yagami-san!\nLooks like the yakuza are onto you!": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san, watch out!\nThe yakuza noticed you!": "",
  "All four of 'em are heading your way!": "",
  "Got it.\nKeep an eye on Mafuyu for me.": "",
  "Yeah... I think so.": "",
  "Who were they?": "",
  "Not a clue. I'm only here\n'cause a friend tipped me off.": "",
  "Sorry, not a clue.\nI'm only here 'cause a friend tipped me off.": "",
  "Kaito-san helped, too.\nDon't forget to thank him later.": "",
  "I don't understand, though.\nWhy would the yakuza come after me?": "",
  "But I... Why would the yakuza come after <font_kind=yakuza_italic>me</font_kind>?\nWhat was that?": "",
  "Sorry, gimme a second.": "",
  "Are you okay, Yagami-san?\nHow's your friend?": "",
  "Yagami-san, you okay?\nHow's your friend?": "",
  "She's okay thanks to you, Sugiura.": "",
  "Sugiura... She's okay,\nthanks to you.": "",
  "Glad to hear it.": "",
  "By the way, I'm tailing that van\nthat tried to nab her.": "",
  "And just so you know,\nI'm tailing that van now.": "",
  "Great. We'll need to figure out\nwhere it was going.": "",
  "Van...? The one they tried to\nshove Mafuyu into?": "",
  "Hello, Izumida-san?\nThis is Fujii.": "",
  "Oh yeah, Yagami-san.\nThose yakuza... were Kyorei.": "",
  "Yagami-san. About those yakuza...\nThey were Kyorei Clan.": "",
  "I recognized a few of them from KJ Art.": "",
  "I recognized a few of them\nfrom KJ Art.": "",
  "Why would the Kyorei go after Mafuyu?": "",
  "We might be better off asking them that in person.\nThink you can head over now?": "",
  "Well, maybe we better ask them in person.\nThink you can head over now?": "",
  "No, I need to make sure Mafuyu gets home\nsafe first. I'll call you later.": "",
  "No, I need to make sure she gets home safe first.\nI'll call you later.": "",
  "I'll be fine, don't worry.": "",
  "Izumida-san says he'll send\nsome officers over for me.": "",
  "The Kyorei Clan is a Kansai-based group, yes?\nThey're the ones who were harassing me?": "",
  "...Aren't the Kyorei Clan based in Kansai?\nYou said that was them back there?": "",
  "Looks like it.\nAs for why...": "",
  "It was probably to get revenge\non the justice system.": "",
  "To get revenge on\nthe justice system.": "",
  "The guy who killed three of their men is still at large,\nwandering the streets of Kamurocho waiting to strike again.": "",
  "The Mole killed three of their guys, right?\nBut he's still out there somewhere.": "",
  "But if that's their reason...\nwhy would they come after me?": "",
  "Wait... If that's their reasoning,\nwhy target me?": "",
  "Aren't there other people\nwho would make more sense?": "",
  "Aren't there other people who would\nmake more sense?": "",
  "Yeah, I guess you're right.\nI should think before I speak.": "",
  "Huh. Maybe you're right...\nI guess not.": "",
  "I bet they just thought you were cute.": "",
  "Oh, I bet they just thought\nyou were cute.": "",
  "Uh, what? That is ridiculous!": "",
  "Um, what? That's not...": "",
  "Er, I shouldn't be making\njokes right now. Sorry.": "",
  "Sorry. This isn't the time\nto be joking around.": "",
  "Yeah, it's still a little fresh...": "",
  "Ah... yeah. I guess not.": "",
  "I think it was probably to get to me.": "",
  "Maybe because you know me.\nMy bad.": "",
  "I got kinda...\ninvolved with the Kyorei Clan.": "",
  "The Kyorei aren't too happy with me.": "",
  "That's gotta have something\nto do with this.": "",
  "So... that might be\nthe root of all this.": "",
  "What are you doing messing with yakuza?": "",
  "You're mixed up with\nKamurocho yakuza...?": "",
  "Uh... what's wrong?": "",
  "I saw them hit you earlier.\nAre you hurt?": "",
  "Back there, it looked like they hit you.\nAre you okay?": "",
  "Uh... No.": "",
  "Ah... yeah.": "",
  "I'm going to make sure\nthis never happens again.": "",
  "I'll make sure that never\nhappens again.": "",
  "I'll sort this out with those Kyorei guys.": "",
  "I'm gonna have a chat\nwith the Kyorei Clan.": "",
  "You can't!\nThat's not safe!": "",
  "You can't.\nIt's not safe.": "",
  "Don't worry about me, okay?\nI'll stay far away from Kamurocho for a while.": "",
  "I'll be fine, really. I'll stay as far away\nfrom Kamurocho as I can.": "",
  "In fact, maybe you should come with me,\nYagami-kun. Lay low for a while.": "",
  "Honestly, Yagami-kun, maybe it'd be better\nif you came with me.": "",
  "Your carriage awaits.\nYou gonna be okay?": "",
  "Looks like your friends are here.\nYou gonna be okay?": "",
  "I'm sorry, but I can't leave now.\nNot yet.": "",
  "Sorry, but I can't leave Kamurocho\nright now.": "",
  "Why though?": "",
  "Why not?": "",
  "It looks like the killer we're after now is somehow\nconnected to the murder three years ago.": "",
  "I've been chasing the Mole's trail.\nHe's connected to the case three years ago.": "",
  "That would mean...\nThe Shinpei Okubo case?": "",
  "Three years ago...?\nThe Shinpei Okubo case?": "",
  "Yeah. Right before Shintani was killed,\nhe tried to contact a researcher named Shono at the ADDC.": "",
  "Yeah. Right before the Mole got him,\nShintani tried to contact a \"Shono\" at the ADDC.": "",
  "The same Shono who testified\nagainst Okubo in the trial.": "",
  "The same Shono who testified against\nOkubo back in the day.": "",
  "That's all you have?": "",
  "...That's it?": "",
  "I'm still trying to piece\neverything together.": "",
  "I'm still trying to put all the\npuzzle pieces together.": "",
  "But I have to keep going until\nthis puzzle is solved.": "",
  "But until I can solve it,\nI have to keep going.": "",
  "You know, it's been three years\nsince I've seen you this worked up.": "",
  "You know, it's been three years since\nI've seen you this worked up, Yagami-kun.": "",
  "It's kinda refreshing, actually.": "",
  "You just look so... alive.": "",
  "You look like you're alive again.": "",
  "Maybe I am.\nSee you later.": "",
  "...See you later.": "",
  "Hey, it's Yagami. I'm free now.\nWhere are you?": "",
  "Sugiura? It's Yagami.\nYou wanna meet up? I'm free now.": "",
  "Turns out the van never even left Kamurocho.\nThey all got out at some sketchy cabaret.": "",
  "Turns out the van never even left Kamurocho.\nThey all got out at some sketch cabaret.": "",
  "Place called Honmaruen\non Park Boulevard.": "",
  "It's on Park Boulevard.\n\"Honmaruen.\"": "",
  "Honmaruen...": "",
  "Kaito-san's heading over, too.": "",
  "Gotcha. I'll be there ASAP.": "",
  "Okay, got it.\nOn my way.": "",
  "Tak, it's Kaito.": "",
  "Tak. It's Kaito.": "",
  "Hey, where are you?\nI'm almost to the cabaret.": "",
  "Hey. I'm almost at the cabaret.\nWhere are you?": "",
  "Right out front.\nSugiura's here too.": "",
  "Right out front.\nSugiura's here, too.": "",
  "Okay, I'll be there in a sec.": "",
  "Got it. I'll be there in a sec.": "",
  "Over here, Tak.": "",
  "This way, Tak.": "",
  "Look.\nThat's the van we tracked.": "",
  "Look.\nThe van from before.": "",
  "Does that mean this is another Kyorei hideout?": "",
  "Think this is another Kyorei hideout?": "",
  "Wouldn't be surprised. Who knows how many\nof the bastards are gonna be in there.": "",
  "Yeah, safe bet. Who knows how many\nare gonna be in there.": "",
  "But are you ready to find out?": "",
  "You ready to find out?": "",
  "Yeah, let's roll.": "",
  "Yeah. Let's do it.": "",
  "Actually... give me a few more minutes.": "",
  "No... Give me a minute.": "",
  "Better make it quick.": "",
  "We'll wait.": "",
  "You ready to move, Tak?": "",
  "Tak. You ready to move?": "",
  "Huh? Hey, do you guys even have a plan!?": "",
  "Uh, hey... you guys have a plan?": "",
  "Don't need one.": "",
  "What!? But there could be\na freaking army in there!": "",
  "Huh!? But there could be\na freaking army in there!": "",
  "Doesn't matter how many there are.": "",
  "Yeah, I don't really care.\nBesides, I'm not in the mood for strategizing.": "",
  "Agreed.\nI'm not in the mood for strategizing.": "",
  "Why not!?": "",
  "C'mon man. You think he's gonna let 'em\nslide after they hit his girl?": "",
  "Can't you tell?\nThey were dumb enough to hurt Mafuyu-chan.": "",
  "You guys are freakin' nuts...": "",
  "Ugh... Dude...": "",
  "Alright, it's all you Tak.\nYou get to take point on this one.": "",
  "All right, go ahead, Tak.\nI'll let you take the first swing.": "",
  "Club's rented out, asshole.\nCan't you fuckin' read?": "",
  "Hey, store's rented out, asshole.\nOr did you miss the sign?": "",
  "Wait, aren't you...\nIt's Yagami!": "",
  "Mm? Wait, you're... Yagami!": "",
  "Stop where you are!": "",
  "Not another step!": "",
  "So. This is where you were gonna\ndrag Mafuyu-chan, huh?": "",
  "Hey, guys. So this is where\nyou were gonna bring Mafuyu?": "",
  "Who gave the order!? Was it Murase?\nOr maybe it was Shioya.": "",
  "Who gave the order?\nWas it Murase? Or maybe Shioya?": "",
  "What's it matter?": "",
  "What's it to you?": "",
  "We wanna talk to the big boys.": "",
  "We want the boss,\nnot the trash.": "",
  "Yeah, what he said.": "",
  "What he said.": "",
  "Shut it! But fine. If you wanna fight...\nBring it on, asshole!": "",
  "Shut the fuck up! Fine, then.\nIf you wanna fight, bring it on!": "",
  "Hey, you're outta step, dumbass!": "",
  "You! You're out of step, dumbass!": "",
  "You're never gonna get any laughs with moves\nlike that! Gimme some fire, chuckleheads!": "",
  "How're you gonna get laughs with moves like that!?\nGive this your fucking all!": "",
  "Now...\nUn! Deux! Trois! Un! Deux! Trois!": "",
  "What the shit is this?": "",
  "Whatever it is,\nit's killing the mood...": "",
  "Aniki! It's Yagami!": "",
  "Heh, we've got him right where we want him.\nBoys! Don't let him leave here alive!": "",
  "Heh, like a fuckin' moth to the fire.\nGet him, boys! He won't leave alive!": "",
  "Another gun!?\nYou know those are illegal, right!?": "",
  "Oh, come on...\nYou know we've got gun laws, right!?": "",
  "Who are you!?": "",
  "It's Yagami! Get him!": "",
  "Hey, that's Yagami!\nFuckin' take him out!": "",
  "Kaito-san. Sugiura.\nYou made it.": "",
  "Kaito-san. Sugiura, too!\nYou're safe.": "",
  "Told ya!": "",
  "'Course we are!": "",
  "Trust us next time, man.": "",
  "Didn't I tell you it'd be fine?": "",
  "Right. Let's get going!": "",
  "Heh... Then let's go!": "",
  "That old man is the person responsible for\nall 10,000 employees in the Kajihira Group.": "",
  "That old man is... the head of all 10,000 employees\nof the Kajihira Group.": "",
  "You're familiar with Hattori-san here, yes?": "",
  "He's told me a great deal about you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "He's shared a great deal, Yagami-san.\nI've learned quite a lot about you.": "",
  "About me?": "",
  "He even clued me in on the perfect\nway to get inside your head.": "",
  "And when I needed to know your weakness...\nHattori-san had just the thing.": "",
  "You better not be talking\nabout Mafuyu-chan.": "",
  "Hey. You saying this\n\"weakness\" of his... is Mafuyu-chan?": "",
  "As I understand it, you two are practically family.\nThe young lady is quite fond of you, you know.": "",
  "She sees Yagami-san as\nfondly as family, wouldn't you say?": "",
  "I take it you're the one who gave Shioya\nthe order to kidnap her then?": "",
  "So Shioya only went after Mafuyu...\nbecause you ordered him to?": "",
  "I wanted to see what\nyou were capable of.": "",
  "Now that I know, the Kyorei Clan will\nleave you alone. I can guarantee that.": "",
  "Now that I know, the Kyorei will\nleave you alone. I can guarantee that.": "",
  "And lemme guess,\nthere's a condition?": "",
  "But lemme guess...\nthere's a condition?": "",
  "There's something I'd like you to do.\nA job only a detective can handle.": "",
  "There's something I'd like you to do.\nA job for a Kamurocho detective.": "",
  "A year ago, I set in motion a plan to redevelop\na massive plot of land owned by the Ministry of Health.": "",
  "Yeah, I know.\nHattori-san's article told me as much.": "",
  "Yeah. Hattori-san's article\ntold me as much.": "",
  "Sharp.": "",
  "Our plan was to take over\nthe entire Medical Institute.": "",
  "Our plan was to take over\nthe entire grounds of the Medical Institute.": "",
  "That's enough land there\nfor three or four Kamurochos.": "",
  "That's enough land for\nthree or four Kamurochos.": "",
  "So, I struck a deal with Minister Kazami, and bought up\nthe surrounding properties for next to nothing.": "",
  "So I struck a deal with Minister Kazami,\nand bought up the surrounding properties at a discount.": "",
  "All that remained was closing down the ADDC\nand the other arms of the Institute.": "",
  "But I don't have enough time on this planet\nto wait for that to just happen naturally.": "",
  "So I turned to a man named Hashiki.": "",
  "So I turned to a man\nnamed Hashiki.": "",
  "Here's a shot of the man.": "",
  "Check the photo I just sent you.\nThat's a shot of him.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I've never seen this guy before...)</color>": "",
  "At the time, Hashiki was the\nvice director of the ADDC.": "",
  "Hashiki was the ADDC's vice director\nat the time.": "",
  "But tempting him to join me was easy enough, and soon\nwe were working together to sabotage the Center.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Sonuvabitch!": "ไอ้สารเลว!",
  "You bastard...": "ไอ้สารเลว...",
  "Glad to hear it.": "ดีใจที่ได้ยินแบบนั้น",
  "Why though?": "แต่ทำไมล่ะ?",
  "Why not?": "ทำไมล่ะ?",
  "Yeah. Let's do it.": "ใช่ ไปกันเลย",
  "Don't need one.": "ไม่ต้องมีก็ได้",
  "Why not!?": "ทำไมล่ะ!?",
  "What's it matter?": "มันสำคัญตรงไหนวะ?",
  "Who are you!?": "มึงเป็นใครวะ!?"
 }
}
